1
00:00:00,551 --> 00:00:01,551
PENNY:
Okay.

2
00:00:01,552 --> 00:00:02,582
(Penny:)Nope. That's it.

3
00:00:02,586 --> 00:00:04,386
(Penny:)We are gonna go
over there right now.

4
00:00:04,388 --> 00:00:06,618
(Penny:)And you are going
to let them out.

5
00:00:06,623 --> 00:00:08,223
(Dr Lorvis:)Three Mississippi,
four Mississippi...

6
00:00:08,225 --> 00:00:11,125
Move it!

7
00:00:14,198 --> 00:00:15,898
(Bernadette:)Oh, good, you're here.

8
00:00:15,899 --> 00:00:17,769
(Bernadette:)Amy, I am so sorry.

9
00:00:17,768 --> 00:00:19,398
(Amy:)That has to wait.
This weirdo locked

10
00:00:19,403 --> 00:00:21,433
(Amy:)the guys up in his basement.
What?!

11
00:00:21,438 --> 00:00:23,108
(Dr Lorvis:)She seems nice. Who's she?
Just walk.

12
00:00:31,248 --> 00:00:33,248
SHELDON:
You can do this.

13
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:35,480
One ladder left!

14
00:00:35,486 --> 00:00:37,316
Oh-ho! Yeah!
Yes!

15
00:00:37,321 --> 00:00:38,621
Next level!

16
00:00:38,622 --> 00:00:40,652
(Penny:)Leonard, are you okay?
Better than okay.

17
00:00:40,657 --> 00:00:43,057
I am having the game of my life!

18
00:00:44,995 --> 00:00:46,765
(Amy:)Dr. Lorvis, isn't there
something you want to say?

19
00:00:46,763 --> 00:00:48,063
(Leonard:)Yes.

20
00:00:48,065 --> 00:00:50,165
(Dr Lorvis:)I'm very sorry
for locking you in my home.

21
00:00:50,167 --> 00:00:51,297
(Howard:)Yeah, that was very uncool.

22
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:52,301
Get the hammer!
Get the hammer!

23
00:00:52,302 --> 00:00:53,332
(Leonard:)Got it.

24
00:00:53,337 --> 00:00:56,507
(guys cheering)

25
00:00:56,507 --> 00:00:58,137
Okay, Leonard, let's go!

26
00:00:58,142 --> 00:01:00,272
J-Just hang on!

27
00:01:00,277 --> 00:01:01,907
(Dr Lorvis:)Well, while we wait,

28
00:01:01,912 --> 00:01:05,312
(Dr Lorvis:)would you like to see Tobey
Maguire's prostate sonogram?

29
00:01:05,315 --> 00:01:07,585
(Bernadette:)Sure.
Yeah.

30
00:01:07,584 --> 00:01:09,284
(Dr Lorvis:)Oh, spoiler alert.

31
00:01:09,286 --> 00:01:11,356
Uh, he was worried
about nothing.

